### HelpSphere Agent — REST smoke tests
### v0.1.0-init · Q2-2026
###
### Use VSCode REST Client extension (humao.rest-client) ou similar.
### Substitua {{AGENT_ENDPOINT}} pelo endpoint real após capítulo 04.
### Substitua {{ACCESS_TOKEN}} por Bearer token (DefaultAzureCredential).

@AGENT_ENDPOINT = https://your-foundry-project.eastus2.api.azureml.ms
@AGENT_ID = helpsphere-agent-v0.1
@ACCESS_TOKEN = your-bearer-token-here

### 1. Health check
GET {{AGENT_ENDPOINT}}/agents/{{AGENT_ID}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

###

### 2. POST chat (single turn — saudação)
POST {{AGENT_ENDPOINT}}/agents/{{AGENT_ID}}/threads/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "user",
  "content": "Olá, sou Diego do time de Operações. Estou com problema na integração SAP FI."
}

###

### 3. POST chat com tool calling expected (search_kb)
POST {{AGENT_ENDPOINT}}/agents/{{AGENT_ID}}/threads/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "user",
  "content": "Como funciona a política de devolução de pedido pra lojista?"
}

###

### 4. GET stats (conversations + escalations count)
GET {{AGENT_ENDPOINT}}/agents/{{AGENT_ID}}/stats?since=2026-05-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

###

### 5. DELETE conversation (cleanup test thread)
DELETE {{AGENT_ENDPOINT}}/agents/{{AGENT_ID}}/threads/{{thread_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

###
